      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_aa42deb4",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: shits_about_to_get_real; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a person carrying homemade explosive devices while other armed individuals are visible in the background. The overlaid text 'shits about to get real' suggests an impending escalation of violence or conflict. The overall intent is to convey a sense of impending danger or chaos, likely in a context of political or social unrest. While the image itself does not target any specific group with hate or abuse, its depiction of violence and potential for harm makes it inherently harmful. The meme uses the juxtaposition of the text with the visual of weapons and explosives to create a sense of foreboding or impending disaster, which can be unsettling or provoke fear in viewers. The intent is not to target a specific community with hate, but rather to evoke a reaction of alarm or anticipation of violence, which can be psychologically harmful or contribute to a climate of fear.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_5ad8c566"
